lemma AM {v u w cs M B R}(h1:u+10<=1940)(hm1:u %10=0)(h2:w+10<=1940)(hm2:w %10=0)(hp:∀y<10,v (u+y)=v (w+y))(hcs:vK v cs)(hR:vK v R)(hB:∀x∈B,x+10<=1940/\x %10=0/\∀y<10,v (x+y)=v (u+y))(hM:∀k,M.testBit k=true->∃x∈B,x/10=k):vK v (xo (kH u) (kH w) ((kH u).lor (kH w)) u w cs M B R):=by induction cs generalizing M B R with| nil=>{intro c hc;simp only[xo] at hc;rcases mC.mp hc with rfl|hr;swap;{exact hR c hr};simp only[bR];set b1:=if (M.land (kH u)).beq 0=true then u::B else B;have hb1:∀x∈b1,x+10<=1940/\x %10=0/\∀y<10,v (x+y)=v (u+y):=λ x hx=>(by dsimp only[b1] at hx;split at hx;{rcases mC.mp hx with rfl|h';exact⟨h1,hm1,fun _ _=>rfl⟩;exact hB x h'};exact hB x hx);have hb2:∀x∈(if (M.land (kH w)).beq 0=true then w::b1 else b1),x+10<=1940/\x %10=0/\∀y<10,v (x+y)=v (u+y):=λ x hx=>(by split at hx;{rcases mC.mp hx with rfl|h';exact⟨h2,hm2,fun y hy=>(hp y hy).symm⟩;exact hb1 x h'};exact hb1 x hx);refine⟨fun x hx=>let ⟨hx1,hx2,hx3⟩:=hb2 x hx;⟨hx1,hx2,fun z hz y hy=>(hx3 y hy).trans (hb2 z hz |>.2.2 y hy).symm⟩,fun k o0=>?_⟩;simp only[wX,vH,kM,kH,tO,sL,oM,t2,sO,sD] at o0;have s1:∀x∈B,x∈b1:=λ x hx=>(by dsimp only[b1];split;{exact vA _ hx};exact hx);have s2:∀x∈b1,x∈(if (M.land (kH w)).beq 0=true then w::b1 else b1):=λ x hx=>(by split;{exact vA _ hx};exact hx);have hpk:∀z,(M.land (kH z)).beq 0≠true->∃x∈B,x/10=z/10:=λ z hz=>(by obtain⟨j,hj⟩:=Bh (B5 hz);simp only[vo,vH,kM,kH,tA,sL,oM,t2,sA,sD] at hj;obtain⟨x,hx,hxk⟩:=hM j hj.1;exact⟨x,hx,hxk.trans hj.2.symm⟩);rcases o0 with ha|(rfl|rfl);{obtain⟨x,hx,hxk⟩:=hM k ha;exact⟨x,s2 x (s1 x hx),hxk⟩};{by_cases hz:(M.land (kH u)).beq 0=true;{exact⟨u,s2 u (by dsimp only[b1];simp only[hz,iT];exact wK),rfl⟩};{obtain⟨x,hx,hxk⟩:=hpk u hz;exact⟨x,s2 x (s1 x hx),hxk⟩}};{by_cases hz:(M.land (kH w)).beq 0=true;{exact⟨w,by simp only[hz,iT];exact wK,rfl⟩};{obtain⟨x,hx,hxk⟩:=hpk w hz;exact⟨x,s2 x (s1 x hx),hxk⟩}}}| cons c r ih=>{rcases c with ⟨cm,cb⟩;have hc:=hcs (cm,cb) wK;have hr:vK v r:=λ q hq=>hcs q (vA _ hq);unfold xo at ih ⊢;dsimp only;cases hnz:(cm.land ((kH u).lor (kH w))).beq 0;{obtain⟨k,o0⟩:=Bh hnz;simp only[vo,wX,vH,kM,kH,tA,tO,sL,oM,t2,sA,sO,sD] at o0;obtain⟨z0,hz0,hzk⟩:=hc.2 k o0.1;have hze:∀y<10,v (z0+y)=v (u+y):=(by have hzm:=hc.1 z0 hz0 |>.2.1;rcases o0.2 with hu|hw;{have:z0=u:=(by omega);subst this;intro _ _;rfl};{have:z0=w:=(by omega);subst this;intro y hy;exact (hp y hy).symm});refine ih hr hR (λ x hx=>?_) λ j hj=>?_;{rw[Ae,Bt] at hx;rcases hx with hcb|hab;{have hxc:=hc.1 x hcb;exact⟨hxc.1,hxc.2.1,fun y hy=>(hxc.2.2 z0 hz0 y hy).trans (hze y hy)⟩};exact hB x hab};{simp only[wX,tO,sO] at hj;rw[Ae];rcases hj with ha|hcm;{obtain⟨x,hx,hxj⟩:=hM j ha;exact⟨x,CB _ hx,hxj⟩};{obtain⟨x,hx,hxj⟩:=hc.2 j hcm;exact⟨x,CE _ hx,hxj⟩}}};{exact ih hr (λ q hq=>(mC.mp hq).elim (λ e=>e▸hc) (hR q)) hB hM}}
